{"unit_id":"devilzyl__dsh-enhance-prompt#feature-1","repo":"devilzyl/dsh-enhance-prompt","commit":"056c7fabbd2b49f1ca878cb48d23b83e4e8fd512","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enhance-prompt 的功能「一键改写草稿」：点击聊天输入框旁的增强按钮，将当前文本交给配置的默认模型，返回更明确且保留原语言的提示词，并替换输入框草稿。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:304-358","index.js:165-205"]}
