{"unit_id":"devilzyl__dsh-enhance-prompt#caveat-1","repo":"devilzyl/dsh-enhance-prompt","commit":"056c7fabbd2b49f1ca878cb48d23b83e4e8fd512","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-enhance-prompt 使用当前 profile 选择的默认 provider 和 model；没有可用模型时，改写请求会返回模型不可用错误，因此使用前需配置可用模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:165-172","index.js:262-269"]}
